Orchbee owns local rule corrections, its parser and sampling integration.
grok.toml adds browser-authentication blockers and an uncertain-login guard, with updated version metadata.
gemini.toml adds a folder-trust blocker, with updated version metadata.
opencode.toml and pi.toml add live-footer idle and status-loader working rules, with updated version metadata.
mimo.toml adapts opencode.toml's OpenCode 1.x rules to MiMo Code, which is built on OpenCode 1.x: its spinner and brand
replace OpenCode's in the working rules, and it adds a workspace-trust blocker and a prompt-footer idle rule.
atomcode.toml, codebuddy.toml, command-code.toml, deveco.toml, jcode.toml, minimax-code.toml, mothx.toml, omp.toml,
prime-agent.toml, reasonix.toml and snow.toml are authored by Orchbee and are not derived from Herdr.
